# 6. Claim object

Every claim must be atomic enough to be assessed independently.

```yaml
claim:
  claim_id: CL-P05-003

  statement:
    Maximal intrinsic causal irreducibility constitutes one phenomenal domain.

  claim_type: identity_claim

  pressure_id: P05

  asserted_by:
    - ARG-IIT-EXCLUSION-01

  dependencies:
    - CL-IIT-CAUSE-EFFECT-POWER
    - CL-IIT-INTEGRATION
    - CL-IIT-EXCLUSION

  status: contested

  confidence:
    logical: low
    textual: high
    empirical: medium
    phenomenological: low

  scope:
    systems: physical
    temporality: synchronic
    modality: nomological

  negation:
    Maximal intrinsic causal irreducibility can occur without phenomenal unity.
```

