# 26. The ten canonical pressure edges

---

## E01-02 — Manifestation to Organisation

[
\text{manifestness}
\stackrel{?}{\longrightarrow}
\text{structured differentiation}.
]

### Exact question

Why is manifestation articulated rather than featureless?

### Live bridges

* *vimarśa*;
* intentional structure;
* fundamental identity–difference;
* informational differentiation;
* Limit and Unlimited.

### Failure point

[
\text{manifestness}
\not\Rightarrow
\text{determinate articulation}.
]

