# 30. Search stopping rule

Research does not stop because the agent has collected many sources.

It stops when one of these occurs:

```yaml
stopping_conditions:
  - a major live model has been reconstructed
  - a decisive countermodel has been found
  - an exact hidden premise has been isolated
  - available evidence cannot discriminate
  - source retrieval has reached a documented textual gap
  - new results become redundant
```

The result may be:

[
\boxed{
\text{underdetermined}
}
]

That is a valid research conclusion.

