# 44. What the system should refuse

The agent must reject requests such as:

> Find parallels between IIT and Tantra.

It should transform them into:

> Compare IIT’s inference from intrinsic causal integration to one phenomenal domain with Pratyabhijñā’s inference from synthesis to one apprehending subject.

It must reject:

